      "trackName": "Magic Wrist",
      "description": "Magic Wrist is an unofficial app that brings random Magic: The Gathering cards straight to your Apple Watch.\nPerfect for inspiration, research, or just killing time.\nTap the left side to filter by card type, rarity, price, or color identity. You can also enable auto-advance mode.\nTap the right side to see detailed info like set, artwork, flavor text, and current price.\nSwipe down in the middle to request a new random card at any time.\nTap once in the center to display only the card image in full-screen, highlighting the artwork.",
